# Rust / Tauri
/target/
dist/
src-tauri/gen/

# The bundled PaddleOCR-json sidecar + models (ticket 31) — ~300 MB,
# fetched from the release archive by packaging/fetch-paddleocr.ps1;
# never committed. The license attribution file IS committed: it satisfies
# tauri's bundle.resources glob (tauri-build rejects an empty match) and
# rides along in the installer, as bundled Apache-2.0 code requires.
/src-tauri/resources/paddleocr/*
!/src-tauri/resources/paddleocr/LICENSE-PaddleOCR-json.txt

# Node (Tauri frontend build)
node_modules/

